      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUMPER CROP (8) went through her maiden campaign unbeaten, highlighted by a win in the Nutrien Classic Sales Final at Wagga when last seen. That was three-and-a-half months ago but she was readied with a trial and should enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw so can maintain the perfect record. KYVALLEY DIXON (1) is hard to knock after winning three of her last five starts, each from a wider barrier than this. Scored the only time she raced here and should get every chance from this inside draw. ZIPPIN PAST (2) showed promise in her first preparation, winning three of five starts including her last outing at Maryborough in May. Draws well and should be fit enough off a couple of trials. ALDEBARAN EMJAY (4) came from wider and broke when resuming so did well to be beaten only 1.4 metres. Fitter and can feature with manners.",
